### Health check
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/health

### Model metrics
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/metrics

### Short urban delivery
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "carrier": "Amazon",
  "distance_km": 8.0,
  "weight_kg": 0.8,
  "route_type": "urban",
  "hour_of_day": 13,
  "day_of_week": 3
}

### Long rural haul
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "carrier": "USPS",
  "distance_km": 420.0,
  "weight_kg": 12.5,
  "route_type": "rural",
  "hour_of_day": 8,
  "day_of_week": 1
}

### Rejected: unknown carrier (422)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "carrier": "PonyExpress",
  "distance_km": 50.0,
  "weight_kg": 2.0,
  "route_type": "urban",
  "hour_of_day": 10,
  "day_of_week": 2
}

### Drift check
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/drift
